      "writtenOn": "2021-11-17T07:12:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you add some comments about what these mean ? Is it like a database version ?\n\nIf so I would encourage you to have simply VERSION_1 and VERSION_2. Right now it looks like you have version names, which you could also do, but while \"init\" is kind of understandable, \"carrier\" doesn\u0027t exactly clearly communicate what this version is about.",
