      "writtenOn": "2021-11-17T07:12:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does this mean for a device with 2 SIMs that is reset ?\ne.g. I buy a device and download an eSIM for carrier1. This becomes subscription ID 1. Later, I insert a SIM for carrier2, and this becomes subscription ID 2. I set policy for carrier 1 to limit at 1GB and for carrier 2 to limit at 2GB.\n\nNow I reset the device, and because the physical SIM is present immediately carrier2 becomes subscriber ID 1. I download the eSIM later, and it becomes subscriber ID 2. If I understand correctly, this scenario ends up with my device having both policies on subscriber ID 1, which is not what the user expects.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 888,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 888,
        "endChar": 32
